WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.596
Hreflang tells Google
which URLs are the English,

2
00:00:04.596 --> 00:00:07.034
German, and French
versions of one page.

3
00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:11.423
General Translation gives
every language its own URL,

4
00:00:11.423 --> 00:00:13.570
the prerequisite for hreflang.

5
00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:18.876
Add hreflang with HTML link tags,

6
00:00:18.876 --> 00:00:24.599
HTTP Link headers, or a sitemap;
Google treats them as equivalent.

7
00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.553
Each version lists
itself and every sibling,

8
00:00:27.553 --> 00:00:29.735
and every link must be reciprocal.

9
00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:33.436
Codes must be valid, such as en-GB,

10
00:00:33.436 --> 00:00:36.105
because Google ignores
the region in en-UK.

11
00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:38.345
With these links in place,

12
00:00:38.345 --> 00:00:42.245
Google can now show German
searchers your German pricing page.
